    <briefdescription>
<para>Indicates that a connection was either closed or that no connection was established from a high duty cycle directed advertising. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>If the application includes the component bluetooth_feature_connection_statistics and the connection was successfully opened, the event <ref refid="group__sl__bt__evt__connection__statistics" kindref="compound">sl_bt_evt_connection_statistics</ref> is automatically triggered just before the connection closed event to provide the application with the final statistic values of the connection. </para>
